{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致多雲有幾陣雨　留意秋風起\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261103-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶覆蓋該區。本港今日(11月3日)天氣預測，大致多雲。早晚有幾陣雨。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望明日風勢仍然較大。星期四部分時間有陽光。星期五風勢逐漸增強，周末期間吹偏東強風。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T23:40:51.588235+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:04:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:39:13.733106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T23:38:27.462752+00:00","content_hash":"3e6430edd747cbf355d1f500c9bde3fef64b0f8e47aff54bfd086a4580f464d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}